= docs: unit artifact milestone 4 -- design, plan, ledger, reports, closed
The milestone-4 design (QAST-only driver first, one stage0 regeneration, the runtime class road
and JAST deleted, adaptors on plain method handles, the three carried gaps time-boxed) and its
11-task plan; code complete at 35/35 jars unit.meta-only, stage0 included, with the older docs
re-dated to the class road's deletion; the two gate regressions (the inlinability table, a
second invocation of one static frame) fixed and the timings re-taken (make 1142 s, CORE.c
467 s); closed with the fix wave's re-review, the parked residuals, the ledger, the reports.
